[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4216087507","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118339#issuecomment-4216087507","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118339","id":4216087507,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc77TGPT","user":{"login":"allenwp","id":17506573,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTA2NTcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17506573?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp","html_url":"https://github.com/allenwp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-09T17:11:12Z","updated_at":"2026-04-09T18:39:57Z","body":"🤩\r\n\r\n> but it can be conditionally skipped (using `WinRTUtils::window_has_display_info`).\r\n\r\nAny chance this PR can be updated to include this? Although this PR does solve the problem of the reference luminance not updating until the window regains focus, the real high-priority impetus for this change is to improve performance significantly by not needing to poll for changes in colour space and max luminance.\r\n\r\nIt will also be critically important to test if the `WM_DISPLAYCHANGE` happening before `DXGI_COLOR_SPACE_RGB_FULL_G22_NONE_P709` problem occurs with this approach. I'd like to test to see if the new advanced colour event happens before `DXGI_COLOR_SPACE_RGB_FULL_G22_NONE_P709` 100% of the time...","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4216087507/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4216802678","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118339#issuecomment-4216802678","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118339","id":4216802678,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc77V012","user":{"login":"allenwp","id":17506573,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTA2NTcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17506573?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp","html_url":"https://github.com/allenwp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-09T19:05:54Z","updated_at":"2026-04-09T19:05:54Z","body":"> Any chance this PR can be updated to include this?\r\n\r\nDerp. My mistake! I think [this PR already does this](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118339/changes#diff-b39afbf5546f4c9f98975d98ac464ebec9f8df4098229ad2267c7cba3d82ac4bR3512)!\r\n\r\nI'll give this a thorough test. It would be great to have this for 4.7...","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4216802678/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4248116297","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118339#issuecomment-4248116297","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118339","id":4248116297,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc79NRxJ","user":{"login":"allenwp","id":17506573,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTA2NTcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17506573?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp","html_url":"https://github.com/allenwp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-14T23:51:46Z","updated_at":"2026-04-14T23:51:46Z","body":"I just tested this on my \"problematic\" computer now. I was able to produce a bug in this PR where the screen would be in HDR output mode (from pressing the Win + Alt + B shortcut), but Godot would think the Window did not support HDR output. This appears to be because a `DXGI_COLOR_SPACE_RGB_FULL_G22_NONE_P709` colour space was still reported for the moments after the new `_winrt_adv_color_info_cb` was called. This is exactly what happens after the `WM_DISPLAYCHANGE` event, so it's not surprising that it would occur with `AdvancedColorInfoChanged` as well.\r\n\r\nBut, the new screen information includes a `CurrentAdvancedColorKind`, which can tell us if we should be in HDR mode and will let us fill out the `ScreenHdrData` struct! So I've made a modified version of this PR that fixes the bug. I tested this by running both this PR and my update at the same time to verify this.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/allenwp/godot/tree/winrt_color\r\n\r\nMy branch has some remaining issues. Specifically, I needed to remove the `const` part of `_get_screen_hdr_data`. Not sure how to avoid this, so that needs some work.\r\n\r\nAlso, in this PR, I'd be fine only including the items we actually will use in the dictionary that `window_get_advanced_color_info` returns instead of filling in all of the other data we'll never use. But I'm not familiar with the preferred code style for this sort of thing.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nAfter doing some more testing, I am now no longer able to reproduce the issue with this PR... but the commit just before this PR (`master`) is now entirely broken on my computer and the `DXGI_OUTPUT_DESC1` is always reporting `DXGI_COLOR_SPACE_RGB_FULL_G22_NONE_P709` until I adjust the SDR content brightness Windows setting or I start Godot with Windows in HDR mode. This doesn't happen with this PR or with my update, which makes no sense to me because I would expect this PR to also have the same issue... So I feel like I'm going a bit crazy here. Either way, I haven't yet seen an issue with my branch.\r\n\r\nI'll continue trying to reproduce these two issues to firmly verify what is going on here and that the behaviour in my branch is the best approach for Godot...","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4248116297/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4249559322","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118339#issuecomment-4249559322","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118339","id":4249559322,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc79SyEa","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-15T05:44:49Z","updated_at":"2026-04-15T07:47:14Z","body":"> Specifically, I needed to remove the const part of _get_screen_hdr_data. Not sure how to avoid this, so that needs some work.\r\n\r\nWhat's causing it not to work with `const`, if it's window data access and non-const `WinRTWindowData *` in utils it should be changed to `const` in utils instead, `has`/`get` functions doesn't write to this pointer.\r\n\r\n> Also, in this PR, I'd be fine only including the items we actually will use in the dictionary\r\n\r\nIf we only need color type, `max_luminance`, and `sdr_white_level` it probably would make sense to use return args instead of `Dictionary`. This is unexposed internal API, so there's no specific requirements.\r\n\r\n> This doesn't happen with this PR or with my update, which makes no sense to me because I would expect this PR to also have the same issue...\r\n\r\nNo idea, but it's possible that working WinRT dispatcher queue for the window can result in DirectX getting some extra system events as well.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4249559322/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4249624580","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118339#issuecomment-4249624580","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118339","id":4249624580,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc79TCAE","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-15T05:58:18Z","updated_at":"2026-04-15T05:58:18Z","body":"I'll apply your changes (+ const fix and change from dict to return args) and retest in a bit later today.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4249624580/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4249816134","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118339#issuecomment-4249816134","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118339","id":4249816134,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc79TwxG","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-15T06:32:06Z","updated_at":"2026-04-15T06:32:06Z","body":"Updated it and it seems to be working fine. I was not able to reproduce issue with Win + Alt + B switching, all HDR data for new and old method is always the same.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4249816134/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4253658414","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118339#issuecomment-4253658414","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118339","id":4253658414,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc79ia0u","user":{"login":"allenwp","id":17506573,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTA2NTcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17506573?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp","html_url":"https://github.com/allenwp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-15T16:15:21Z","updated_at":"2026-04-15T16:15:21Z","body":"Thanks, if my computer is still producing the weird bug with the dev releases, I’ll post an issue and demonstrate that this PR fixes it. Yesterday, at least, it became very consistent. I must have some funny NVIDIA drivers or something for my 5070 Ti…","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4253658414/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4254515420","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118339#issuecomment-4254515420","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118339","id":4254515420,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc79lsDc","user":{"login":"allenwp","id":17506573,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTA2NTcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17506573?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp","html_url":"https://github.com/allenwp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-15T18:33:20Z","updated_at":"2026-04-15T18:33:20Z","body":"I've created a bug report. This PR fixes the bug: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118618","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4254515420/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4254652050","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118339#issuecomment-4254652050","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118339","id":4254652050,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc79mNaS","user":{"login":"allenwp","id":17506573,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTA2NTcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17506573?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp","html_url":"https://github.com/allenwp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-15T18:56:29Z","updated_at":"2026-04-15T18:56:29Z","body":"I've requested review from blueskythlikesclouds, also cc @DarkKilauea. You two are both familiar with this code, so I figure you might want to take a look.\r\n\r\nIn short, this PR should prevent any of the \"legacy\" HDR screen info functions from running and instead exclusively use the new WinRT advanced colour info functions and event when they are available. This should improve performance by not needing to poll anything and also seems to fix two bugs that I had been experiencing relating to the colour space that `DXGI_OUTPUT_DESC1` was reporting. Windows emulation and older versions of Windows can use the old legacy method, since this is the only option to make these work.\r\n\r\nI have reviewed the changes to `DisplayServerWindows` and they look good to me, but I can't comment on the rest of the files, since I'm not familiar with those. I have not approved this PR yet because it will take quite a bit of testing over the next few days on systems with different configurations before I'm confident that there aren't any unexpected bugs. I'll report back when I've built and exported with MinGW and tested on computers like laptops with built-in HDR screens.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4254652050/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4261068350","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118339#issuecomment-4261068350","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118339","id":4261068350,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc79-r4-","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-16T14:56:31Z","updated_at":"2026-04-16T14:56:31Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4261068350/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]